  "remarks": "Ruslan Arefiev is a Russian banking executive serving as President-Chairman of the Management Board of CMRBank, a financial institution active in the occupied Ukrainian territories subject to Union restrictive measures, and as a member of the Board of Directors of CMRBank Abkhazia. He previously held senior positions at the Russian National Commercial Bank (RNCB).",
